<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador is deploying more than 2,000 soldiers to Haiti to locate four missing Salvadoran personnel after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince. Haitian gangs have launched a major attack that killed 47 people, prompting condemnation from the UN chief. The Haitian government has postponed the presidential election to July 2027. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck0e075n79j5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPV1FsRG13WUFFS1B2SUUwZ0prZzlWX1I2NE9jT2pqY0w3RWNoMG14NVIyWlVrNG4yZ0x0WFBBRXRFQkRaY0U1ZWlhdzRqZHZWWWhyRG9MNzBkQllQejE3U2RteWF1VU1nWk1FS1YtakRKSk9HV0otNGNlUUhSRVp4WlRZMWx4TmloUkF5anlWS0JPTWNTN1cxQVpJOTBhQ283dTBvMlJFZnlUUGVKQWNqdDFRZnVFS0Z0WnFxUktPR1R4VDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQeEpfM3JDZjVOTHV0VjdWaVN0WnE2QW9fRDBoY0hqWmZIUm5DZ0xLRV9Na0Z3WGttclo4UTdGRl9TdUJ4R3F3UTVsU2ZBUkxoU0lRSmQyZ2FKWTA4X0xxMUdPYmpsZmt2SHdoTjRUN2R5UVllVlRTcEpsTzNONjZxU3Z3WGdBcThQUVVlMU15d01UVnBlSnBwdnczRFdLNmpwdFltcEFVeGdWRG1uRnl3Sjd5bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9oZk5sRkFKRDBrUmNHcTVxTFQ3LUNDUG44b